MODULE: NoAbortedPrepareAbortScanned
TARGET: NoAbortedPrepare
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: terminal materialisation installs an aborted source value and rebuild subsequently scans it
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
    /\ source' = IF outcome' = "commit"
--- REPLACE
    /\ source' = IF outcome' \in {"commit", "abort"}
--- END
